// Docker localnet enables every remaining gated method. Asserts the deprecation
// header when an allowlisted call reaches the JSON-RPC server.
>> {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"sei_getSeiAddress","params":["0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000001"]}
<< {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"error":{"code":-32602,"message":"failed to find Sei address"}}
@ expect_response_header Sei-Legacy-RPC-Deprecation
